{"steam_appid":2436940,"steam_name":"Sephiria","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2436940/1818105550/0e1b83dac55fd18ce1f873fb2dccc81fda7e3889/1783515034/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1783515614","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257372994/239e161e5a40b7e5385fdfe271dd7cc7c31f7966/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1783515614","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/ss_6dc776bb4cd7565deba0801e6c51389d008c0e74.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785481238","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/e32a0ae752605eda419afc5597ae4c0517ba8cb5/ss_e32a0ae752605eda419afc5597ae4c0517ba8cb5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785481238","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/b7b9021771f16b098660a444717bd5d60569fa9a/ss_b7b9021771f16b098660a444717bd5d60569fa9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785481238","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/a2039a9cc1a64e4dac460e2793eafc2c2de74fe4/ss_a2039a9cc1a64e4dac460e2793eafc2c2de74fe4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785481238","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/ss_ff782818e49493b5fd0a99a83987d9d415d3af71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785481238"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the Day of Destiny, a terrible omen strikes Bunnyville. The bunny villagers will be slaughtered by a horde of demons… unless you can stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.poster.avif?t=1785481238\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.webm?t=1785481238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/f92670d3542f17d2f554383dc0c5cb19.mp4?t=1785481238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sephiria is a fate-defying action roguelite following a brave bunny on a quest to save their town from doom. Master and upgrade different weapons, unlock new Talents each run, strategically arrange your inventory, and fight through hordes of enemies to uncover the threat waiting at the journey's end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.poster.avif?t=1785481238\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.webm?t=1785481238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/49bc5018fd6c6a461dbaeb69371f4733.mp4?t=1785481238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic inventory system:</strong> Collect and arrange Artifacts and empower them with the different Tablets. Manage your inventory to suit your abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom combat:</strong> Master 6 distinct weapons, each with over 50 unique upgrades to unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-changing threats:</strong> Face more than 60 distinct and dangerous enemies, and over 10 unique bosses. Across a journey spanning 6 chapters, the challenges ahead grow ever greater.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces:</strong> Team up with friends in online co-op for up to 4 players and explore the tower together. Trade items, revive fallen companions, and claim victory as a team!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.poster.avif?t=1785481238\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.webm?t=1785481238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436940/extras/02c7bba34adf5dfe4dfa99b6ca50d99a.mp4?t=1785481238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTS 750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1700X or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 760 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["TEAM HORAY"],"publishers":["TEAM HORAY"],"release_date":"31 Jul, 2026"}